  end

  subgraph L2["Level 2 · Evidence"]
    E1["<b>Data</b><br/>First-half pace implies ~$83bn, below the 2017 baseline of ~$101bn and even below 2019; energy at 7% of its target; 1m barrels a day at $40 still yields only $7.36bn"]
    E2["<b>Studies & sources</b><br/>PIIE purchase tracker; Reuters on crude loadings; S&P Global on cancelled LNG cargoes; IMF growth forecast"]
