    M1["<b>Mechanism A</b> · <i>kind: economic</i><br/>There is no policy lever in manufacturing — import substitution continues and trade does not run through a few buyers"]
    M2["<b>Mechanism B</b> · <i>kind: economic</i><br/>Seasonality blocks catch-up, and because targets are nominal a commodity price crash widens the gap without any change in volume"]
  end

  subgraph L4["Level 4 · Intermediate claims"]
    C1["<b>Intermediate claim</b><br/>Category by category: manufacturing will not close the gap, agriculture is behind but Q4 is still live, energy is effectively impossible"]
